  "description": "In an effort to escape the power struggle within the Heavenly Demon Sect, the protagonist Myeong-Un retreats to a life of seclusion. However, simply avoiding ambition for the throne is not enough to avert tragedy. Myeong-Un flees from the sect leader Myeong-Gak, who seeks fratricide, before meeting his demise. At the moment of his death, as his consciousness fades, he hears a voice. \"Do you regret it? Do you wish to fight again?\"\" To his surprise, Myeong-Un, believed to be dead, opens his eyes once more....\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
